                                                                                            <div class="the-content margin-top-45"><p>At Tutoring Club, we are NOT one-size-fits-all, classroom-style, proceed at a single pace, white-board style prep. We believe strongly in individualized programs designed to provide test-taking strategies that reduce anxiety and improve recall. Further, we are firm believers in targeting only those areas in which students do not demonstrate mastery. After prep, students walk into these critical exams with the knowledge and confidence to achieve excellent results.</p>
