                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>

                                            
                                                <div class="single-testimonial">
                                                    <div>
                                                        <div>
                                                            <div class="the-content text-center">
                                                                I could not express how appreciative I am for all the teachers at Tutoring Club. Everyone is very good at teaching and my daughter has grown to love to learn. The facility is very clean. Everyone is nice and helpful. My daughter’s grades have all gone up. She has attended Tutoring Club for 6 months. She just finished her MAP testing and is now in the 90th percentile across the national board. Thank you everyone at Tutoring Club. I know we will continue to use you for help with homework and supplemental learning.                                                            </div>
